{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slug Poker!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105360/extras/b024cfaccfedbf20f505571cdb0a5995.poster.avif?t=1771652110\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105360/extras/b024cfaccfedbf20f505571cdb0a5995.webm?t=1771652110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105360/extras/b024cfaccfedbf20f505571cdb0a5995.mp4?t=1771652110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Lucky Hive is a poker game about playing with your friends and having fun. It's also about staying clear of the Broodmother...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the wonderful game of poker with your friends, playing as colourful characters that represent different aspects of what goes on within the Hive. It's all about relaxing (or getting really, really competitive) with your friends and to try win the biggest hands through all sorts of strategies available to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Great For Beginners and Long-Time Players Alike</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poker can be a daunting game, with hand strengths, side pots and vast nomenclature (what is a flop and who the hell is Under the Gun?), so The Lucky Hive provides a fantastic way for you to experience the amazing game of poker without being thrown into the deep end.<strong>\u00a0No microtransactions, no real money, just an incredible card game to relax and enjoy!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Single-player &amp; Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105360/extras/7e40488d5fc6c82ef43acfd6a078d43f.poster.avif?t=1771652110\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105360/extras/7e40488d5fc6c82ef43acfd6a078d43f.webm?t=1771652110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105360/extras/7e40488d5fc6c82ef43acfd6a078d43f.mp4?t=1771652110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Lucky Hive supports up to 6-player lobbies, but also has AI characters you can verse for a single-player experience (plane, trains and automobiles).\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Win The Biggest Hand!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105360/extras/714b60c746ccd7f9482ef80ef0f32bd3.poster.avif?t=1771652110\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105360/extras/714b60c746ccd7f9482ef80ef0f32bd3.webm?t=1771652110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105360/extras/714b60c746ccd7f9482ef80ef0f32bd3.mp4?t=1771652110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use bluffing to your advantage to win the biggest hand, or overplay your bets to deceive your opponents! Every tactic is fair game in the Hive...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More Being Added</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New mechanics are constantly being added to The Lucky Hive, such as player item effects, dealer events and maybe even alerting the Broodmother... Seeing as the game is currently in development, more will be added as we continue our creation of this amazing game!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4105360?t=1771652110","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105360/5b1ca41a406eec0917f8aa270b33da22ab0dce8f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771652110","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105360/6553178aca3405e15e58292aa7f43ebaebc7b44b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771652110","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105360/6553178aca3405e15e58292aa7f43ebaebc7b44b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771652110","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slug Poker!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105360/extras/b024cfaccfedbf20f505571cdb0a5995.poster.avif?t=1771652110\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105360/extras/b024cfaccfedbf20f505571cdb0a5995.webm?t=1771652110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105360/extras/b024cfaccfedbf20f505571cdb0a5995.mp4?t=1771652110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Lucky Hive is a poker game about playing with your friends and having fun. It's also about staying clear of the Broodmother